      "title": "Calculating Sums and Scalar Multiplication of Column Vectors"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "Let the column vectors be\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$a=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$b=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$c=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nFind $a - (5b - 2c)$.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$a - (5b - 2c)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\na - (5b - 2c) &= \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\left(5\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-2\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-15 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -14\\end{bmatrix}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ 24\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}13 \\\\ -23\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
